{"id":"temur-tundra","name":"Temur tundra","type":"location","aliases":["snowy tundra"],"description":"The vast snowy Temur tundra where Sarkhan arrives in the past.","pages":1,"first_seen":"2014-12-31","last_seen":"2014-12-31","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A New Tarkir of Old","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-12-31","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A New Tarkir of Old\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 31 Dec 2014."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31-e0","summary":"Sarkhan emerges in darkness on a snowy Temur tundra after passing through the flaming gate, with the gate gone and Ugin's voice silent.","participants":["sarkhan-vol","ugin"],"location":"temur-tundra","importance":"major","page":"stories/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31","order":53,"story_date":"2014-12-31","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":6,"quote":"But now he was standing still in the darkness in the middle of a vast, snowy Temur tundra.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31#:~:text=But%20now%20he%20was,vast%2C%20snowy%20Temur%20tundra.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A New Tarkir of Old","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-12-31","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31#:~:text=But%20now%20he%20was,vast%2C%20snowy%20Temur%20tundra.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A New Tarkir of Old\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 31 Dec 2014."}},{"id":"new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31-e1","summary":"Sarkhan