magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31#:~:text=You%20can%27t%20be%20silent%20now%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A New Tarkir of Old\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 31 Dec 2014."}},{"id":"new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31-e3","summary":"A storm of luminous clouds breaks over the tundra and dragons emerge from the tempest, to Sarkhan's amazement.","participants":["sarkhan-vol","dragons-of-tarkir"],"location":"temur-tundra","importance":"major","page":"stories/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31","order":53,"story_date":"2014-12-31","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":42,"quote":"A dragon!","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31#:~:text=A%20dragon%21","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A New Tarkir of Old","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-12-31","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31#:~:text=A%20dragon%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A New Tarkir of Old\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 31 Dec 2014."}},{"id":"new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31-e5","summary":"Sarkhan follows the fledglings' flight across the tundra, believing this to be his path of healing for his plane.","participants":["sarkhan-vol","dragons-of-tarkir"],"location":"temur-tundra","importance":"minor","page":"stories/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31","order":53,"story_date":"2014-12-31","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":66,"quote":"This was his path, the path that Ugin had set him on, the path of healing for his plane.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31#:~:text=This%20was%20his%20path%2C,healing%20for%20his%20plane.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A New Tarkir of Old","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-12-31","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31#:~:text=This%20was%20his%20path%2C,healing%20for%20his%20plane.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A New Tarkir of Old\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 31 Dec 2014."}},{"id":"new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31-e6","summary":"A great dominant dragon arrives and leads the fledglings in formation to hunt.","participants":["dominant-dragon","dragons-of-tarkir","sarkhan-vol"],"location":"temur-tundra","importance":"major","page":"stories/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31","order":53,"story_date":"2014-12-31","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":79,"quote":"She had come to lead them. Now they would hunt.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31#:~:text=She%20had%20come%20to,Now%20they%20would%20hunt.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A New Tarkir of Old","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-12-31","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31#:~:text=She%20had%20come%20to,Now%20they%20would%20hunt.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A New Tarkir of Old\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 31 Dec 2014."}},{"id":"new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31-e7","summary":"The dragons raid a human encampment in a basin while Sarkhan watches in awe.","participants":["dragons-of-tarkir","dominant-dragon","sarkhan-vol"],"location":"temur-tundra","importance":"major","page":"stories/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31","order":53,"story_date":"2014-12-31","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":82,"quote":"The brood descended like a barrage of flaming arrows.",