news/magic-story/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31#:~:text=And%20with%20a%20rush,disappeared%20into%20the%20night.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A New Tarkir of Old\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 31 Dec 2014."}},{"id":"new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31-e11","summary":"Sarkhan, enraged, is about to attack the warrior but is stopped by a calm memory of how dragons brought balance, and his anger turns to awe at her.","participants":["sarkhan-vol"],"location":"temur-tundra","importance":"minor","page":"stories/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31","order":53,"story_date":"2014-12-31","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":116,"quote":"She was a survivor—no, a conqueror!—following a battle with dragons.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31#:~:text=She%20was%20a%20survivor%E2%80%94no%2C,a%20battle%20with%20dragons.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A New Tarkir of Old","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-12-31","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31#:~:text=She%20was%20a%20survivor%E2%80%94no%2C,a%20battle%20with%20dragons.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A New Tarkir of Old\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 31 Dec 2014."}}],"relations":[],"pages_say":[{"page":"stories/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31","order":53,"story_date":"2014-12-31","presence":"appears","source":"wizards","description":"The vast snowy Temur tundra where Sarkhan arrives in the past.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A New Tarkir of Old","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-12-31","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/new-tarkir-old-2014-12-31","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-stor